<view class="biz-card"
  ><text class="biz-heading">文案与配音</text
  ><textarea
    class="biz-input textarea"
    value="{{script}}"
    maxlength="500"
    placeholder="输入旁白或字幕文案，也可以从原声识别…"
    bindinput="input"
  /><view class="biz-row"
    ><view
      ><text>语音转文字</text
      ><text wx:if="{{!config.asr}}" class="biz-note"
        >语音识别接口待配置</text
      ></view
    ><switch
      checked="{{transcribe}}"
      disabled="{{!config.asr}}"
      data-field="transcribe"
      bindchange="toggle"
      color="#9BCBAA" /></view
  ><view class="biz-row"
    ><view
      ><text>AI 改写文案</text
      ><text wx:if="{{!config.rewrite}}" class="biz-note"
        >请在后台选择改写模型</text
      ></view
    ><switch
      checked="{{rewrite}}"
      disabled="{{!config.rewrite}}"
      data-field="rewrite"
      bindchange="toggle"
      color="#9BCBAA" /></view
  ><view class="biz-row"
    ><view
      ><text>AI 配音</text
      ><text wx:if="{{!config.tts}}" class="biz-note"
        >请在后台启用配音模型</text
      ></view
    ><switch
      checked="{{narration}}"
      disabled="{{!config.tts}}"
      data-field="narration"
      bindchange="toggle"
      color="#9BCBAA" /></view
  ><block wx:if="{{narration}}"
    ><picker range="{{modelNames}}" value="{{modelIndex}}" bindchange="model"
      ><view class="biz-row"
        ><text>配音模型</text
        ><text class="accent">{{modelNames[modelIndex]}} ›</text></view
      ></picker
    ><picker
      wx:if="{{voices.length}}"
      range="{{voices}}"
      value="{{voiceIndex}}"
      bindchange="voice"
      ><view class="biz-row"
        ><text>音色</text
        ><text class="accent">{{voices[voiceIndex]}} ›</text></view
      ></picker
    ></block
  ><view class="biz-row"
    ><text>自动字幕</text
    ><switch
      checked="{{captions}}"
      data-field="captions"
      bindchange="toggle"
      color="#9BCBAA" /></view
  ><text wx:if="{{captions}}" class="biz-note"
    >有识别时间轴时沿用时间轴；手动或改写文案按时长分句生成字幕。</text
  ></view
>
